  "title": "A Sweet Way to Celebrate a Record-Breaking Quarter",
  "summary": "By Maddie Billings, Office & HR Support Associate Success is always worth celebrating, especially when it reflects the hard work and dedication of an entire team. On July 16, employees at our site in Rocklin, California, enjoyed a special lunchtime treat from the Snowie King truck as part of an employee appreciation event recognizing our highest quarterly revenue on record. […]",
